  (text "I2C1 pull-ups: R401 (SCL) and R402 (SDA), 4.7k to +3V3_SYS, are the\nONLY pull-ups on I2C1. Bus master = STM32 PB6/PB7 (STM32 Core sheet).\nU401: DPS368 drawn with the BMP280 symbol (pin-identical per DPS368 DS\nv1.1 Table 2). VERIFY LGA-8 land pattern vs DPS368 DS Fig.18 before layout."
    (at 105.41 125.73 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6f566291-8d84-4fd8-9d0e-087a751f90ca")
  )
  (text "SPI3 dedicated to blackbox flash; FLASH_CS = PA15."
    (at 168.91 185.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9609f0e3-953b-4f35-8358-abaf7bed31be")
  )
